      "html": "<p>A medium-sized (around 15 cm) pike cichlid from Paraguay. The fish received represent the form depicted as Crenicichla cf. edithae in Stawikowski &amp; Werner (2004: 140). Occasionally Crenicichla edithae is regarded as a synonym of C. lepidota.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
      "source": "glaser",
